## Deployment

### Static Hosting

For static hosting, build the application and deploy the `dist/` folder:

```bash
# Build for production
ng build

# Deploy to Netlify
netlify deploy --prod --dir=dist/<%= projectName || 'angular-app' %>

# Deploy to Vercel
vercel --prod --name <%= projectName || 'angular-app' %>

# Deploy to GitHub Pages
ng build --base-href "https://username.github.io/repo/"
```

### Docker Deployment

```dockerfile
# Dockerfile
FROM node:20-alpine as builder

WORKDIR /app
COPY package*.json ./
RUN npm ci
COPY . .
RUN npm run build

FROM nginx:alpine
COPY --from=builder /app/dist/<%= projectName || 'angular-app' %> /usr/share/nginx/html
COPY nginx.conf /etc/nginx/conf.d/default.conf
EXPOSE 80
CMD ["nginx", "-g", "daemon off;"]
```

```yaml
# docker-compose.yml
version: '3.8'
services:
  app:
    build: .
    ports:
      - "80:80"
    restart: unless-stopped
```

